 "text": "Your baby outgrew the baby bathtub, but you're not ready to give them the whole tub yet. The big tub feels huge and it takes so much water. That's exactly the stage this Schnuggle toddler bath is designed for. It's bigger than their baby bath, but still gives them their own little space for bath time. There's a soft backrest and a grippy surface inside, and there's room for bath toys so they can enjoy splashing around. The only problem? They won't wanna get out. With the holidays coming, it makes a sweet gift too. Check it out for your toddler's next bath. It's in the orange cart.",
